# ==============================================================================
# Cloudflare R2 Educational CDN Configuration for Techno Wallah
# ==============================================================================
# Steps to set up your free Cloudflare R2 bucket:
# 1. Log in to your Cloudflare Dashboard (https://dash.cloudflare.com)
# 2. In the left sidebar, click "R2" -> click "Create bucket"
# 3. Name your bucket: technoedu-materials (or any name you prefer)
# 4. In your bucket page, click "Settings" tab:
#    - Under "Public Access", click "Enable" next to "R2.dev subdomain"
#      (This gives you a free instant public URL like: https://pub-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx.r2.dev)
#    - OR click "Connect Domain" to attach a custom domain (e.g. cdn.technowallah.in)
# 5. In the R2 sidebar on the right, click "Manage R2 API Tokens":
#    - Click "Create API token"
#    - Name: "TechnoEdu-Harvester"
#    - Permissions: "Object Read & Write"
#    - Bucket: Select your bucket (or "All buckets")
#    - Click "Create API Token"
# 6. Copy your credentials into a new file named .env in the root directory:
# ==============================================================================

CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=your_cloudflare_account_id_here
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your_r2_access_key_id_here
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your_r2_secret_access_key_here
R2_BUCKET_NAME=technoedu-materials
R2_PUBLIC_URL=https://pub-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx.r2.dev
